      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Function",
      "Anchor": "function",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The functions API provides standardized job function data across the LinkedIn platform. It is a collection\nof function entities.\nThis API doesn\u2019t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Function",
      "Anchor": "function",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Functions represent broad job function categories on LinkedIn (e.g., Accounting, Engineering, Sales). Each standardized Title belongs to a function.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Function",
      "Anchor": "function",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Function",
      "Anchor": "function",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Get a function entity for an ID.\nGet all functions.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Retrieve Function IDs",
      "Anchor": "how-to-retrieve-function-ids",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Retrieve Function IDs"
      ],
      "Text": "Use GET_ALL with pagination to list all functions. Function URNs (e.g., urn:li:function:4) also appear in responses from the Titles API (function field). Extract the numeric ID from the URN to use with this API.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
